frame.create {"rect":[60,955,490,1170],"content":"text","text":"⏱️ Time Management: Efficient sprint delivery and task prioritizing.\n\n🤝 Teamwork: Collaborative code reviews and pair programming.\n\n🧩 Problem-Solving: Systematic algorithmic debugging mindset.\n\n⚡ Adaptability: Rapid learning curve for modern frameworks.\n\n🎯 Attention to Detail: Pixel-perfect UI and clean modular code.\n\n💬 Empathetic Communication: Clear bilingual technical dialogues."}
