frame.create {"rect":[60,1695,490,2135],"content":"text","text":"• Institution: SENA (Servicio Nacional de Aprendizaje)\n\n• Center: Centro de Diseño y Metrología\n\n• Program: Tecnólogo en ADSO (Ficha 228118)\n\n• Modality: 100% Virtual Technologist Degree\n\n• Location: Popayán, Cauca, Colombia\n\n• Competency: 240202501 (English B1.2+)\n\n• Evidence: GA6-240202501-AA1-EV01\n\n• Evaluation Instrument: IE-GA6-240202501-AA1-EV01\n\n• Word Count Compliance: 567 Words (500-700 Range)\n\n• Design Tool: DesignCraft Studio CLI v0.18.0"}
