frame.create {"rect":[580,310,1530,335],"content":"text","text":"1. WHO AM I? (Personal Identity, Educational Background & Core Values)"}
object.color {"color":"#065F46","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":12.5,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Bold"}}
frame.create {"rect":[580,345,1530,665],"content":"text","text":"My name is Karen Yuliana Campo, a dedicated and proactive technologist apprentice in Software Analysis and Development (ADSO) at the National Learning Service (SENA), studying in a fully virtual modality from Popayan, Cauca, Colombia.\n\nFrom an early age, I discovered a profound passion for technology, logical reasoning, and creative problem-solving. As an apprentice studying remotely through modern digital environments, I define myself as an analytical, disciplined, and curious person who views programming not merely as writing lines of source code, but as a transformative instrument to build purposeful digital solutions that optimize human productivity and business operations.\n\nThroughout my academic journey, I have cultivated a resilient mindset, embracing complex challenges as valuable learning opportunities, while remaining deeply committed to ethics, collaborative growth, and continuous self-improvement in fast-paced software environments."}
object.color {"color":"#0F172A","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":10.5,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Regular"}}
frame.create {"rect":[560,700,1550,1040],"shape":"rectangle","content":"graphic"}
object.fill {"swatch":"BlueLight"}
object.cornerOptions {"shape":"rounded","size":10}
object.stroke {"swatch":"BlueBorder","weight":1.5}
frame.create {"rect":[580,715,1530,740],"content":"text","text":"2. WHAT PROGRAM OR POSITION AM I APPLYING FOR? (Target Role & Focus)"}
object.color {"color":"#1E40AF","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":12.5,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Bold"}}
frame.create {"rect":[580,750,1530,1025],"content":"text","text":"I am enthusiastically applying for the position of Junior Full-Stack Software Developer, with a specialized focus on modern Frontend Web Engineering and Responsive User Interface Architecture.\n\nMy objective is to integrate into a progressive, forward-thinking software engineering team where I can apply my technological expertise to build intuitive, scalable, and high-performance digital products.\n\nSpecifically, I aim to contribute to the lifecycle of modern web applications, encompassing user-centered requirements elicitation, UI prototype modeling, component-driven frontend development, and resilient database communication within agile development teams."}
object.color {"color":"#0F172A","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":10.5,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Regular"}}
frame.create {"rect":[560,1060,1550,1600],"shape":"rectangle","content":"graphic"}
object.fill {"swatch":"AmberLight"}
object.cornerOptions {"shape":"rounded","size":10}
object.stroke {"swatch":"AmberBorder","weight":1.5}
frame.create {"rect":[580,1075,1530,1100],"content":"text","text":"3. WHY AM I FIT FOR THIS PROGRAM OR POSITION? (Technical & Soft Skills)"}
object.color {"color":"#B45309","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":12.5,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Bold"}}
frame.create {"rect":[580,1110,1530,1585],"content":"text","text":"I am highly qualified for this role because my profile harmoniously combines comprehensive technical competence with strong interpersonal skills developed through rigorous, hands-on project work. During my SENA training, I led the architectural conception and frontend development of \"Pizzeria Bella Italia,\" a comprehensive web-based management and delivery platform.\n\nOn the technical spectrum, I have developed solid proficiency in modern web standards:\n• Frontend Development: Advanced semantic HTML5, modern CSS3 adhering to the 8dp modular spatial grid, 16dp margins, Fitts's Law, and WCAG accessibility standards.\n• Reactive Logic & Prototyping: JavaScript (ES6+), DOM event-driven manipulation, modular architecture, and vector interface design using DesignCraft CLI.\n• Data Persistence & Architecture: Designing normalized relational database models in MariaDB and MySQL (1NF, 2NF, 3NF), alongside document-oriented NoSQL collections in MongoDB.\n• Engineering Rigor: Strict adherence to Test-Driven Development (TDD) using automated unit testing frameworks, clean code principles, and Git version control workflows.\n\nBeyond hard technological proficiencies, my soft skills set me apart as a dependable team player. My time management allows me to meet sprint deadlines under pressure without sacrificing code reliability. My empathetic communication fosters smooth teamwork in cross-functional environments, and my adaptability empowers me to quickly master emerging software libraries and methodologies."}
object.color {"color":"#0F172A","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":9.8,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Regular"}}
frame.create {"rect":[560,1620,1550,2070],"shape":"rectangle","content":"graphic"}
object.fill {"swatch":"PurpleLight"}
object.cornerOptions {"shape":"rounded","size":10}
object.stroke {"swatch":"PurpleBorder","weight":1.5}
frame.create {"rect":[580,1635,1530,1660],"content":"text","text":"4. WHAT ARE MY FUTURE GOALS? (Career Aspirations & Long-Term Vision)"}
object.color {"color":"#6D28D9","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":12.5,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Bold"}}
frame.create {"rect":[580,1670,1530,2055],"content":"text","text":"My professional aspirations are structured into concrete milestones. In the short term, upon successfully concluding my technologist degree, I plan to consolidate my role as a Junior Full-Stack Developer within a collaborative tech company, contributing to production-grade repositories and earning professional certifications in Cloud Computing (AWS/Azure) and advanced frontend frameworks.\n\nIn the medium and long term, my ambition is to evolve into a Lead Software Architect and Scrum Master, directing international development squads and architecting distributed web systems.\n\nFurthermore, I aspire to leverage bilingual English proficiency to collaborate with global tech talent, mentoring new apprentices and championing sustainable, inclusive software solutions that generate lasting social impact."}
object.color {"color":"#0F172A","text":true}
type.char {"attrs":{"size":10.5,"fontFamily":"Segoe UI","fontStyle":"Regular"}}
frame.create {"rect":[560,2085,1550,2150],"shape":"rectangle","content":"graphic"}
